   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1762560000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "origin/main 911498220, 2026-11-09. 356 modules under hisim/ (inputs excluded), measured by agent-tmp/seams/import_graph.py (ast, every import statement, function-local ones counted as lazy).\nGrey arrows are allowed by the proposed map (downward, or sideways inside the contracts, the orchestration or one sibling column). Red arrows are the violations: a sibling importing\nanother sibling, anything below knowing a component class, an upward import. 13 package edges carrying 149 import statements. Numbers: import statements (static, +lazy).\nNot drawn: the 76 static + 14 lazy imports and 24 importlib calls between modules of hisim.components, the 36 importlib calls in all, and the string import of hisim.economics inside postprocessing_main.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "origin/main 911498220, 2026-11-09. 356 modules under hisim/ (inputs excluded), measured by agent-tmp/seams/import_graph.py (ast, every import statement, function-local ones counted as lazy).\nGrey arrows are allowed by the proposed map (downward, or sideways inside the contracts, the orchestration or one sibling column). Red arrows are the violations: a sibling importing\nanother sibling, anything below knowing a component class, an upward import. 13 package edges carrying 149 import statements. Numbers: import statements (static, +lazy).\nNot drawn: the 76 static + 14 lazy imports and 24 importlib calls between modules of hisim.components, the 36 importlib calls in all, and the string import of hisim.economics inside postprocessing_main.",
   "lineHeight": 1.15,
   "autoResize": true
  }
